      "side": 1,
      "message": "Manually force BIST share test mode works for TDA.2.3.1.1 only if I set it after DUT receive get sink cap. But it will be hard for GRL to check when is get sink cap be received.\n\nIf I set it before execute the test, DUT will get hard reset when tester request 0A.",
