      "writtenOn": "2022-09-12T03:26:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this test, \n\nThe Tester gets the UUT into PD Mode (PROC-PD-MODE), initially requesting PDO#1 at 100mA.\n\nand \n\nRepeat the next 4 steps at no load, 25% full load, 50% full load, 75% full load, 100% full load, 75% full load, 50% full load, 25% full load and no load (9 separate Requests per PDO).",
      "parentUuid": "c3201440_00f25336",
      "revId": "7c6d9844724018b5a8c7c3b81be6e65388bf0e28",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
